From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:06:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: load MPEG audio data URL metadata asynchronously

Parse MPEG Layer III frame/Xing metadata for audio data URLs, including a
zero-count Info header fallback. Queue trusted durationchange/loadedmetadata
events, expose finite duration and readiness, and invalidate stale source tasks.
Handle parser-created sources, MIME case, malformed input and playback-state
transitions without fetching remote media or decoding PCM.

Sephora diagnostics identified a pending SDK executor assigning
onloadedmetadata on a data-URL MP3. Metadata loading releases that observed
five-Promise collection chain; it does not by itself release the binary SDK
POST or recover authentication. All temporary Promise hooks, VM rewriting
and debugger routing were removed.

Validation: 1658 upstream tests; 11 temporary media reductions; MPEG
version/CRC/Xing/LAME/ID3 and malformed-boundary fixtures; normal
uninstrumented Sephora capture. No new upstream tests.
---
 src/browser/frame/node_factory.zig        |  1 +
 src/browser/media/mpeg_audio.zig          | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/browser/webapi/element/html/Media.zig | 87 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/browser/media/mpeg_audio.zig

